  "goodToKnow": "Anrühren means to touch, often negated: das Essen nicht anrühren, keinen Alkohol anrühren (not touch a drop). In cooking it means to mix: Farbe, Teig, Gips anrühren. Rühren means to stir and to move emotionally: gerührt sein. Berühren is the neutral word for touch, and rührend means touching. Regular: rührte an, angerührt."
